{
  "design": "Leave-one-campaign-out (9 folds). Point prediction: RF fitted on the 8 training campaigns. Calibration: CV+/cross-conformal-style inner leave-one-campaign-out on the training campaigns, so every calibration residual comes from a model that did not see its campaign. Finite-sample quantile ceil((n+1)(1-a))/n.",
